{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Iaune": 25,
    "Paimon": 3,
    "Player": 8
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2401901",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Iaune",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240190101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240190101": {
            "id": "240190101",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "Well, that's all the feed I got. Hope they're all full...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190102"
            ]
          },
          "240190102": {
            "id": "240190102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What are you up to?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190103"
            ]
          },
          "240190103": {
            "id": "240190103",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "I'm feeding these gulls. See, they've almost had their fill.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190104"
            ]
          },
          "240190104": {
            "id": "240190104",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa... When did you and them grow so close?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190105"
            ]
          },
          "240190105": {
            "id": "240190105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "They didn't steal your fries?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190106"
            ]
          },
          "240190106": {
            "id": "240190106",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "No. It seems that people specifically come here to feed the gulls, so they've no interest in my fries.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190107"
            ]
          },
          "240190107": {
            "id": "240190107",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But didn't you say that if you got too far from your workplace, you might miss work?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190108"
            ]
          },
          "240190108": {
            "id": "240190108",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "Hahaha, it's alright. Today's my day off.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190109"
            ]
          },
          "240190109": {
            "id": "240190109",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "No colleagues here to drag me into work-related chat, and no one or animal to steal my fries... Yes, this is a most suitable place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190110"
            ]
          },
          "240190110": {
            "id": "240190110",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "The gulls are a friendly lot. They won't steal my fries, nor will they come charging into me to cause a riot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190111"
            ]
          },
          "240190111": {
            "id": "240190111",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "Ever since I fed them personally a few times, they seem to recognize me. They don't seem to resist even when I touch their feathers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190112"
            ]
          },
          "240190112": {
            "id": "240190112",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "I'd go so far as to call them perfect gentlemen compared to the ilk at the Palais Mermonia.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190113"
            ]
          },
          "240190113": {
            "id": "240190113",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "If they could use their talons to write using typewriters, why, they'd nearly put us out of work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190115",
              "240190117"
            ]
          },
          "240190115": {
            "id": "240190115",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "But at least they don't make things worse, either. And everyone knows that some things are simply too hard for them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190118"
            ]
          },
          "240190118": {
            "id": "240190118",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "But let's leave that aside first. Would you like to try making friends with these gentle-gulls?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190119"
            ]
          },
          "240190119": {
            "id": "240190119",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whew, they're already gentle-birdies in your eyes, huh..."
          },
          "240190117": {
            "id": "240190117",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "I wouldn't be so sure. Perhaps they simply pretend so that they may live more comfortable lives."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401902",
      "subQuestName": "Feed the Violetgold Angler Gulls",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401903",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Iaune",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240190301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240190301": {
            "id": "240190301",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "What did I say, eh? Real gentlemen — far better mannered than those ruffians near the Palais Mermonia.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190302"
            ]
          },
          "240190302": {
            "id": "240190302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "They were very well-mannered.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190303"
            ]
          },
          "240190303": {
            "id": "240190303",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "I know, right? Makes me feel relaxed just sitting here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190304"
            ]
          },
          "240190304": {
            "id": "240190304",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "I mean, just imagine being a gull yourself. With people coming over to feed you, all you need to do is sunbathe and think about the meaning of life...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190305"
            ]
          },
          "240190305": {
            "id": "240190305",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "*sigh* Why am I a Gestionnaire and not a Violetgold Angler Gull?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401908",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240190801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240190801": {
            "id": "240190801",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "How... How could you do that? They're not the ruffians in front of the Palais Mermonia, you know!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190802"
            ]
          },
          "240190802": {
            "id": "240190802",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Sorry, it was an accident...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190803"
            ]
          },
          "240190803": {
            "id": "240190803",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "*sigh* I didn't even have time to stop you. Why did you do that... Did one of them attack you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240190804"
            ]
          },
          "240190804": {
            "id": "240190804",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "Regardless, they're gone now. Oh well. I'll have to come back in a few days and offer them some food as an apology..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401950",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240195001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240195001": {
            "id": "240195001",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "I specially processed this fish. Take it and put it in that bowl over there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240195002"
            ]
          },
          "240195002": {
            "id": "240195002",
            "speakerId": 5084,
            "speakerName": "Iaune",
            "text": "Just relax. Violetgold Angler Gulls are a tolerant lot. They like whoever feeds them, and they ask no questions about where you got your fish or how it was made."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}